      "customfield_10001" : "1_*:*_1_*:*_230029403751_*|*_5_*:*_1_*:*_0",
      "customfield_10012" : "0|i0038v:",
      "customfield_10300" : "{}",
      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "I think there are two bugs - but they collaborate so that the net result is that (without a workaround) - curl doesnt support ssl.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "First but - openssl 1.1 now depends on pthreads, but doesnt include ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "type" : "strike"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "lpthread in the resulting pkgconfig files. A workaround for this is to add -lpthread to the CONFIGURE line (I didnt bother since may not be right for all platforms",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : " just right for when using pthreads)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "But also - the 'fix' I did include - because its needed - is to include in the libcurl makefile workaround - LIBS='-pthread'",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
